---
description: Visual contract for Grok Voice screens. Read DESIGN-LANGUAGE.md before any UI change.
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `DESIGN-LANGUAGE.md` at the repo root before adding or restyling a screen, sheet, dialog, widget, or theme.

Follow it. In particular:

- Themes swap with `data-appearance` and may set only the semantic tokens listed in that file. No raw hex in components.
- No pure black or white. Minimum text is 13px. Touch targets are at least 44px. Keep WCAG contrast.
- Radius stays on the 0–4px tokens. Do not outline cards, chips, or secondary buttons. Use tonal surfaces and hairlines. No corner brackets, glass, gradients, or tinted icon boxes.
- One accent (`--brand`), plus `--positive` and `--negative` for money. Hero numbers use the 2:1 number-to-unit tokens.
- Primary actions are solid fills. Secondary actions are underlined text.
- Motion uses the duration and easing tokens. Page transitions stay opacity-only on Android.
- User-facing copy is plain in en, es, de, pt, and ca-ES-valencia. Escape apostrophes in Android XML.

Finance chart, holdings, and ledger files may be owned by another change. Prefer token and shared-component edits so Finance inherits them.
